# Hari's creperie website

Multilingual (5 languages) website with a QR-code menu for a restaurant / creperie in Montenegro.
Domain: **https://restoranharis.com**

This file is the single source of truth for the project. Read it fully before making changes.

> If an older `CLAUDE.md` exists in this project, **this README replaces it** (the old one has the wrong brand assumptions, old font variable names and no design system).

---

## 1. Brand and open questions

The logo reads **"creperie hari's, waffle ice cream"**: a round badge, maroon and peach on a transparent background (an older version said "waffle pan cake"). The business is therefore a **creperie** (crepes, waffles, ice cream), a sweet place, and not a traditional restaurant.

**Not yet confirmed with the client. Do not hardcode these, keep them in one place (`data/site.ts`) so they are easy to change:**

- Public name: "Hari's" vs "Restoran Haris" (domain is `restoranharis.com`). Provisional: **Hari's** (`site.name`); in running text **Hari's Creperie** (`site.fullName`, used in the hero heading)
- Photos of the place and the food: **one so far**, `public/images/hero/mobile-bg.jpg` (the phone hero). The tablet and desktop hero images (`tablet.jpg`, `desktop.jpg`, see "Hero" in section 9) are still stock placeholders that must be replaced before launch.
- Address, phone, opening hours, social links, GPS coordinates: **unknown. Use clearly marked TODO placeholders, never invent them.**
- Menu categories: **the categories of the client's printed menus, all of them, with their printed names and in their order** (user, 2026-10-19; `data/menu/index.ts`): the main menu (*Jelovnik*, `main-menu-small.pdf`) **Doručak, Potaži, Burgeri, Pica, Salate, Slatke krepe, Penkejk, Slatke vafle, Slane krepe, Budi sam svoj šef, Naši proizvodi**, then the two menus of their own, **Slatka karta** (October 2026: Kafa, Šejk, Milkšejk, Limunada, Topla čokolada, Kup, Desert and Sladoled as its sections) and **Posni meni** (client's PDF, October 2026). Every category has its dishes and prices. Prices are EUR only (the PDF's "6.40 RSD" for Banana split is a typo: user, 2026-10-16). The first list from the client (2026-10-06: Doručak, Ručak, Večera, Dezerti, Posni meni, Hari's Kolači, Sladoledi, Voćne torte, Piće) is replaced; Slatka karta was three cards (Piće, Dezerti, Sladoledi) until 2026-10-19.
- Original vector logo (SVG/AI/PDF): the provided file is `public/logoharis.png` (1200x1200 PNG, transparent background, the same badge as the printed menu). The older `public/logo.png` ("waffle pan cake", 567x529) is no longer used.

