## 7. i18n setup

Implemented. The files are the source of truth; the snippets show their shape.

**`i18n/routing.ts`**
```ts
import { defineRouting } from "next-intl/routing"

export const routing = defineRouting({
  locales: ["me", "en", "it", "ru", "tr"],
  defaultLocale: "me",
  localePrefix: "as-needed",
  // Must stay false: a tourist's browser language must never redirect the
  // QR scan (/meni) away from Montenegrin.
  localeDetection: false,
  pathnames: {
    "/": "/",
    "/meni": { me: "/meni", en: "/menu", it: "/menu", ru: "/menyu", tr: "/menu" },
    "/meni/[category]": { me: "/meni/[category]", en: "/menu/[category]", it: "/menu/[category]", ru: "/menyu/[category]", tr: "/menu/[category]" },
    "/galerija": { me: "/galerija", en: "/gallery", it: "/galleria", ru: "/galereya", tr: "/galeri" },
    "/o-nama": { me: "/o-nama", en: "/about", it: "/chi-siamo", ru: "/o-nas", tr: "/hakkimizda" },
    "/kontakt": { me: "/kontakt", en: "/contact", it: "/contatti", ru: "/kontakty", tr: "/iletisim" },
  },
})

// Order of the codes in the language switcher
export const switcherLocales = ["en", "ru", "it", "tr", "me"] as const

// Native names, read by screen readers next to the codes in the switcher.
// The same in every language.
export const localeNames = {
  me: "Crnogorski", en: "English", it: "Italiano", ru: "Русский", tr: "Türkçe",
} satisfies Record<(typeof routing.locales)[number], string>
```
`switcherLocales` and `localeNames` live here and not in `messages/*.json` because they are identical in every language.

**`i18n/navigation.ts`**
```ts
import { createNavigation } from "next-intl/navigation"
import { routing } from "./routing"

export const { Link, redirect, usePathname, useRouter, getPathname } =
  createNavigation(routing)
```

**`i18n/request.ts`**
```ts
import { hasLocale } from "next-intl"
import { getRequestConfig } from "next-intl/server"
import { routing } from "./routing"

export default getRequestConfig(async ({ requestLocale }) => {
  const requested = await requestLocale
  const locale = hasLocale(routing.locales, requested)
    ? requested
    : routing.defaultLocale

  return {
    locale,
    messages: (await import(`../messages/${locale}.json`)).default,
  }
})
```

**`proxy.ts`** (Next 16 name for `middleware.ts`)
```ts
import createMiddleware from "next-intl/middleware"
import { routing } from "./i18n/routing"

export default createMiddleware(routing)

export const config = {
  matcher: "/((?!api|_next|_vercel|.*\\..*).*)",
}
```
The matcher skips API routes, Next/Vercel internals and any path with a dot, so `/sitemap.xml`, `/robots.txt` and images are untouched.

**`next.config.ts`**
```ts
import type { NextConfig } from "next"
import createNextIntlPlugin from "next-intl/plugin"

const withNextIntl = createNextIntlPlugin()

const nextConfig: NextConfig = {}

export default withNextIntl(nextConfig)
```

**`global.d.ts`**: types `useLocale()`, `Link` and `t()` keys against the real config. A missing or misspelled message key is a type error.
```ts
import type { routing } from "@/i18n/routing"
import type messages from "./messages/me.json"

declare module "next-intl" {
  interface AppConfig {
    Locale: (typeof routing.locales)[number]
    Messages: typeof messages
  }
}
```

**Static rendering:** `app/[locale]/layout.tsx` exports `generateStaticParams`, checks the locale with `hasLocale` (else `notFound()`), and sets `<html lang={hreflang[locale]}>`, which is `sr-Latn-ME` for `me`. Every layout/page under `[locale]` calls `setRequestLocale(locale)` first. Because `Locale` is typed, pages cast the param (the layout has already validated it). `meni/[category]/page.tsx` adds its own `generateStaticParams` (the category slugs, run once per locale) and `dynamicParams = false`, so an unknown slug is a 404.

`setRequestLocale` is marked deprecated in next-intl 4.14 in favour of `next/root-params` (next-intl.dev/blog/nextjs-root-params). It still works. Migrating means changing the layout, every page and `i18n/request.ts` together, so do it as its own task.

```tsx
import type { Locale } from "next-intl"
import { getTranslations, setRequestLocale } from "next-intl/server"

export default async function MenuPage({ params }: PageProps<"/[locale]/meni">) {
  const { locale } = await params
  setRequestLocale(locale as Locale)
  const t = await getTranslations("menu")
  // ...
}
```

