Install with the CLI as needed: `button`, `tabs`, `card`, `badge`, `sheet` (mobile nav), `dropdown-menu`, `separator`, `skeleton`. Installed so far: `button`, `sheet`, `dropdown-menu`, `card`, `skeleton` (its `animate-pulse` gets `motion-reduce:animate-none`). The generated files import `cn` from the `cn` package (shadcn's clsx + tailwind-merge replacement, a dependency); that is correct.

