- Links: Meni · Galerija · O nama · Kontakt (`nav.*` messages; Galerija added 2026-10-06), Lora semibold `text-base md:text-lg` (bigger from `md`, client 2026-10-14), `gap-6`, cream text. The current page is peach with `aria-current="page"` (`nav-links.tsx`, a client component because it reads the pathname). On a sub-page (Meni on `/meni/dorucak`) the link is peach too, with `aria-current="true"`.
