## 14. Deployment (Vercel)

1. Push to GitHub, import the repo in Vercel, deploy with default settings.
2. Add `restoranharis.com` and `www.restoranharis.com` under Settings -> Domains. Use the DNS records Vercel shows. Pick one as primary and redirect the other.
3. HTTPS is automatic.
4. Vercel's free Hobby plan is for non-commercial use. A client business site belongs on Pro (check vercel.com/pricing) or another host.
5. The domain should be registered to the client, so printed QR codes never die.

